~ start
Croxy: [wave]Hissssssssss...[/wave]
The looming lava lizard looms over you hissing as it spots you approaching.
Croxy: Welcome to my lair... [wave]hissssss.[/wave]
Croxy: You're here because of Mio? Well them him I don't need his help!
- He misses you a lot.
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
    Croxy: Very well then! [wave]hissssss.[/wave]
	Croxy: I challenge you to a battle, get ready to fight!
    do WorldDialogueManager.StartBossBattle()
    => END
- Oh okay I'll get right on that.
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
    Croxy: Good.
    do WorldDialogueManager.EndDialogue()
    => END
	
~ BackForMore
Croxy: Back sssso ssssoon?
- Yes
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
    do WorldDialogueManager.StartBossBattle()
	 => END
- I just got lost. I'll get going again.
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
	Croxy: Oh...
    do WorldDialogueManager.EndDialogue()
    => END
	
~ PostBattle
Croxy: I accept my defeat... You have bessssted me.
You hear a click and a rumbling in the distance as if a path has opened.
Croxy: Here, take thisssss. You have earned it.
"You received [color=yellow]Croxy[/color]'s card."
do WorldDialogueManager.EndDialogue()
=> END